{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id1052104531"}, "name":{"label":"hamster chan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-13T05:53:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.16.0"}, "id":{"label":"14422596530"}, "title":{"label":"Should be banned from use"}, "content":{"label":"I have never come across a more unreliable, awful banking app. You can make the app look nice but if it regularly times out when you use QR Cash. Also there are many outages, it’s literally 9pm on a Thursday night and yet again for the second time this month it’s inaccessible because of “maintenance”. Cannot get cash out, cannot pay bills. Also regularly it fails to register advanced payments and regularly times out when you want to take cash out. Absolute trash. I cannot believe the HKMA tolerates this rubbish. For a multibillion dollar bank, someone really needs to lose their job over this.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
